#: ../main.lua:1008
msgid ""
"Usage Tips\n"
"\n"
"Select:\n"
"Highlight text (or a word) in the book, then press [AI assistant] in the poped up menu.\n"
"\n"
"Long Press:\n"
"- On a Prompt Button: Add to the highlight menu.\n"
"- On a highlight menu button to remove it.\n"
"- On the Close button to go back to the book in 1 step.\n"
"\n"
"Very-Long Press (over 3 seconds):\n"
"On a single word in the book to show the highlight menu (instead of the dictionary).\n"
"\n"
"Multi-Swipe (e.g., ⮠, ⮡, ↺):\n"
"On the result dialog to close (as the Close button is far to reach).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tiqciṭin n useqdec\n"
"\n"
"Fren:\n"
"Freq aḍris (neɣ awal) deg wedlis, sin akin, senned ɣef [AI assistant] deg umuɣ i d-ibanen.\n"
"\n"
"Asenned aɣezfan:\n"
"- ɣef tqeffalt n Prompt: rnu ɣer umuɣ n usefreq.\n"
"- ɣef tqeffalt n umuɣ n usefreq iwakken ad tt-kkseḍ.\n"
"- ɣef tqeffalt n umdal iwakken ad tuɣaleḍ ɣer wedlis deg 1 n usurif.\n"
"\n"
"Asenned aɣezfan nezzeh (ugar n 3 n tasinin):\n"
"ɣef yiwen n wawal deg wedlis iwakken ad d-iban umuɣ n usefreq (deg umkan n umawal).\n"
"\n"
"Aswept aṭas (am. ⮠, ⮡, ↺):\n"
"ɣef usqif n ugmu iwakken ad yemdel (imi tqeffalt n umdal tebɛed).\n"

